title: "Sarcasm Understanding via Multimodal and Contextual Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Evaluation framework for a five-condition study of sarcasm understanding,
  crossing input modality (audio+text vs. text-only) with conversational
  context, over five audio-language models and seven text-only LLMs.
